flowchart LR
    Analyst[Authorized analyst] --> UI[Streamlit dashboard]
    UI --> Intake[File validation and parsing]
    Intake --> Evidence[(SQLite evidence records)]
    Evidence --> Timeline[Timestamp normalization]
    Evidence --> IOC[Regex indicator extraction]
    Evidence --> Rules[Local rule-based classification]
    Timeline --> Report[Evidence-linked draft generator]
    IOC --> Report
    Rules --> Report
    Report --> DB[(SQLite reports and reviews)]
    Analyst --> Review[Edit / In Review / Approve / Reject]
    Review --> DB
    DB --> Export[JSON / TXT / PDF export]
    API[Optional localhost FastAPI] --> DB
    External[External AI / network IOC lookup] -. disabled by default .-> Rules
